{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04266","headline":"边城落日 · 骆宾王","name":"边城落日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫塞流沙北，黄图灞水东。\n一朝辞俎豆，万里逐沙蓬。\n候月恒持满，寻源屡凿空。\n野昏边气合，烽迥戍烟通。\n膂力风尘倦，疆场岁月穷。\n河流控积石，山路远崆峒。\n壮志凌苍兕，精诚贯白虹。\n君恩如可报，龙剑有雌雄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04266.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04266","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}